  "description": "Hi team,\n\nPlease find below the CSS\u202fLint configuration we\u2019ll be using for the upcoming release. The adjoining\u2011classes rule is turned off, while the box\u2011model rule is set to error. Box\u2011sizing will generate a warning, and bulletproof\u2011font\u2011face is disabled. Compatible\u2011vendor\u2011prefixes will raise a warning, display\u2011property\u2011grouping is off, and duplicate\u2011background\u2011images will warn. Duplicate\u2011properties is treated as an error; empty\u2011rules is disabled; fallback\u2011colors will warn; floats is an error; font\u2011faces is off; font\u2011sizes will warn; gradients is disabled; ids is an error; import is off; important will warn; known\u2011properties is an error; outline\u2011none is off; overqualified\u2011elements will warn; qualified\u2011headings is disabled; regex\u2011selectors will warn; shorthand is an error; star\u2011property\u2011hack is off; text\u2011indent will warn; underscore\u2011property\u2011hack is disabled; unique\u2011headings will warn; universal\u2011selector is off; unqualified\u2011attributes will warn; vendor\u2011prefix is an error; and zero\u2011units is disabled.",
